{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15204260","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15204260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1520426001:0":{"text":"Where did that rotten meat come from?","source_cn":"那些腐烂的肉，是从哪里来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5026476E742DBE2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520426002:0":{"text":"Uh... it was from old hunts.","source_cn":"肉？呃……是之前打猎打到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CF0A8EC5396F4C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520426003:0":{"text":"There used to be plenty of animals—mongrels, wild sheep... all sorts.","source_cn":"以前这附近有很多动物，土狗、野羊……各种各样，什么都有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BFD425EEBE7F3DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520426004:1":{"text":"But since the famine, they've grown fewer and weaker... and now, we haven't seen one in a long time.","source_cn":"不过自从饥荒开始，这里的动物也越来越少，越来越瘦……到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE39F33C414307041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520426005:0":{"text":"All that rotten meat was from <style=\"highlight\">Zeffi's</style> hunts ages ago. That's why it spoiled like this...","source_cn":"这些腐烂的肉，都是好久之前<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6C9D71B45A66F02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1520426005":{"text":"All that rotten meat was from <style=\"highlight\">Zeffi's</style> hunts ages ago. That's why it spoiled like this...","source_cn":"这些腐烂的肉，都是好久之前<style=highlight>泽菲罗大哥</style>打到带回营地的，所以才会坏成这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6C9D71B45A66F02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520426006:0":{"text":"Mhm, he's five years older than me. I guess that counts?","source_cn":"嗯，他比我大五岁，应该算是大人吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x87727A30578C1A0B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Mhm, he's five years older than me. I guess that counts?","female":"Mhm, he's five years older than me. I guess that counts?","variant_male_record_index":"186019","variant_female_record_index":"186020","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520426007:0":{"text":"But... he's not in camp now...","source_cn":"不过他……他现在不在营地……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC597F0BC22BBE8DB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But... he's not in camp now...","female":"But... he's not in camp now...","variant_male_record_index":"186021","variant_female_record_index":"186022","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520426009:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog122>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1504E60403DB3196","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...","female":"...","variant_male_record_index":"186025","variant_female_record_index":"186026","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520426010:0":{"text":"No need to panic. We just want to know where everyone went.","source_cn":"不必紧张，我们只是想知道大家都去了哪里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7D936874EDF66E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1520426011:0":{"text":"Look around—this camp is all children. Even with a reliable boy like you, they still need adult supervision, don't they?","source_cn":"你看，营地里有这么多孩子。即便有可靠的你在，但依然不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99AF96280701931B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520426012:0":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog56>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DE8F285726FB570","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520426013:0":{"text":"I don't know!","source_cn":"我……我不知道！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x289EBACDB215D413","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1520426014:0":{"text":"Tolo suddenly spins and runs off.","source_cn":"托洛猛地转过身去，径直跑走了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x380A0BAC9D4048EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520426015:1":{"text":"Why is he running? We didn't hurt him.","source_cn":"他为什么要跑？我们没有对他做什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC33857E9D41A119F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1520426016:1":{"text":"Told you, don't pry if you don't want ugly answers.","source_cn":"早就和你们说过，没必要打听这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7637B90212A3814A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1520426017:0":{"text":"Forget it. <style=\"highlight\">I'll check.</style> Stay here.","source_cn":"算了，<style=highlight>我去看看</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF566CD330F10F23C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1520426017":{"text":"Forget it. <style=\"highlight\">I'll check.</style> Stay here.","source_cn":"算了，<style=highlight>我去看看</style>。你们别跟过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF566CD330F10F23C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1520426018:1":{"text":"What, you expected a search party?","source_cn":"对，我。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3567F32FDE51D5CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What, you expected a search party?","female":"What, you expected a search party?","variant_male_record_index":"186035","variant_female_record_index":"186036","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1520426021:0":{"text":"Merlin, babysit the newbies and don't let them follow me. I work better alone.","source_cn":"梅林，看好他们，别跟上来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E08D641E4763D17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:1520426022:0":{"text":"Morgan leaves with a grim expression.","source_cn":"摩根阴沉着脸离开了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97B0244CB6EA6C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1520426023:0":{"text":"... We're really letting him go alone?","source_cn":"……真的让摩根去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22757BA3C9B67B31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1520426024:0":{"text":"Don't worry.","source_cn":"无需忧心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB66243C8D5E4456F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1520426025:0":{"text":"When ordinary people are trapped in hardship, Morgan never stands idle. I've seen it myself.","source_cn":"请相信我，当普通人囿于困顿之境，摩根绝不会袖手旁观，这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EFDAA8F21EE5297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1520426026:1":{"text":"Until he and Tolo return, help me <style=\"highlight\">distribute the cooked meat</style>. These children have suffered long enough, they need some relief.","source_cn":"在他和托洛返回之前，就请陪我<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A9A86102FF1810E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"... You?","source_cn":"……你？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B12C7CA7A7DA9DB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... You?","female":"... You?","variant_male_record_index":"78815","variant_female_record_index":"78816","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1520426019:1":{"text":"Comfort? Please. I plan to annoy him into talking.","source_cn":"哄？我是要去嘲笑他。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA542C9EE1DA301","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Comfort? Please. I plan to annoy him into talking.","female":"Comfort? Please. I plan to annoy him into talking.","variant_male_record_index":"186037","variant_female_record_index":"186038","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:1:2":{"text":"You know how to comfort kids?","source_cn":"你会哄小孩吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x950FFD6DF74617BB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_